ine, and VitaDAO, the largest decentralized community for longevity science. Building on these successes, BIO is designed to catalyze an onchain scientific economy through decentralized funding, incentives and liquidity.\n\nThe BIO token gives holders access to BIO's network of scientific communities and IP, enabling broad exposure to the DeSci economy."}, "links": {"homepage": ["https://www.bio.xyz/"], "whitepaper": "https://docs.bio.xyz/bio", "blockchain_site": ["https://etherscan.io/token/0xcb1592591996765Ec0eFc1f92599A19767ee5ffA", "https://intel.arkm.com/explorer/token/bio-protocol", "https://ethplorer.io/address/0xcb1592591996765Ec0eFc1f92599A19767ee5ffA", "https://solscan.io/token/bioJ9JTqW62MLz7UKHU69gtKhPpGi1BQhccj2kmSvUJ", "https://basescan.org/token/0x226A2FA2556C48245E57cd1cbA4C6c9e67077DD2", "https://bscscan.com/token/0x226a2fa2556c48245e57cd1cba4c6c9e67077dd2", "https://binplorer.com/address/0x226a2fa2556c48245e57cd1cba4c6c9e67077dd2"], "official_forum_url": ["https://warpcast.com/bioxyz", "https://www.youtube.com/@bio_acc"], "chat_url": [], "announcement_url": [], "snapshot_url": null, "twitter_screen_name": "bioprotocol", "facebook_username": "", "bitcointalk_thread_identifier": null, "telegram_channel_identifier": "bio_protocol", "subreddit_url": null, "repos_url": {"github": [], "bitbucket": []}}, "image": {"thumb": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/53022/thumb/bio.jpg?1735011002", "small": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/53022/small/bio.jpg?1735011002", "large": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/53022/large/bio.jpg?1735011002"}, "country_origin": "", "genesis_date": null, "contract_address": "0xcb1592591996765ec0efc1f92599a19767ee5ffa", "sentiment_votes_up_percentage": 100.0, "sentiment_votes_down_percentage": 0.0, "watchlist_portfolio_users": 17022, "market_cap_rank": 406, "market_cap_rank_with_rehypothecated": 542, "market_data": {"current_price": {"aed": 0.088497, "ars": 36.1, "aud": 0.03455851, "bch"